---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy | Cosmicrafts">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-400 tracking-widest">LEGAL</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight mt-2 mb-4">Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      Accounts and sign-in for Cosmicrafts run on World of Unreal Identity and are governed by the
      canonical policy at <a class="underline" href="https://worldofunreal.com/privacy">worldofunreal.com/privacy</a>
      (Controller: World of Unreal · Contact: privacy@worldofunreal.com). This page only adds Cosmicrafts specifics.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-white font-bold mt-6 mb-2">Cosmicrafts specifics</h2>
    <p>
      Fleet data, ranks, governance votes, and SPIRAL claim records are gameplay data tied to your
      identity. See also <a class="underline" href="/docs/legal">Legal &amp; Disclaimers</a> for token risk disclosures.
      Wallet addresses you connect are public on-chain by nature.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">Rights and deletion: <a class="underline" href="mailto:privacy@worldofunreal.com">privacy@worldofunreal.com</a> — replies within 45 days.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
